    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "💫 · New couples · Guided audio · AI"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Explore together<br>without <em>pressure.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "With a new partner, intimacy can feel tricky to navigate. Caresse creates a comfortable framework where you discover your shared desires together — guided by a voice, not by the unknown."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                \n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n            </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Available on iOS & Android · Free demos · Paid personalized sessions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Why Caresse for new beginnings?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Building connection from the start."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "The first weeks of a relationship are decisive. Caresse helps you communicate your desires naturally, without the hard-to-find words."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🌱</div>\n                \n                <h3>Break the ice gently</h3>\n                \n                <p>Caresse creates a structured framework that removes the pressure of initiative. No need to \"suggest\" — you configure together and the voice takes over.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">💬</div>\n                \n                <h3>Communicate your desires</h3>\n                \n                <p>The session setup becomes a natural conversation about your preferences and boundaries — without judgment, in a safe framework.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🛡️</div>\n                \n                <h3>Built-in consent</h3>\n                \n                <p>Caresse weaves natural consent and comfort reminders into every session — laying healthy foundations for your relationship from the start.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎨</div>\n                \n                <h3>Explore at your own pace</h3>\n                \n                <p>Start gentle, go further when you feel ready. Caresse adapts to the intensity you choose — never more, never less.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "how"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "how-inner"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "how-text"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-label"
                  },
                  "html": "What Caresse brings"
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "h2",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-title"
                  },
                  "html": "A framework of trust to discover each other better."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "section-sub"
                  },
                  "html": "New couples often struggle to articulate their desires. Caresse transforms that difficult conversation into a shared and enjoyable experience."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ul",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "trust-list"
                  },
                  "html": "\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> No need for explicit initiative, the voice guides</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> Configuring together = natural conversation about desires</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> Consent and comfort built into every session</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> No visual content, everything in the imagination</li>\n                    <li><span class=\"check\">✦</span> All orientations and dynamics welcome</li>\n                "
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse suitable for very new relationships?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — Caresse is designed for all relationship stages. Intensity levels can start very gently, from romantic to more explicit. You choose."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How does Caresse help talk about desires?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The session setup is a list of preferences to explore together — atmosphere, practices, dynamics. It's a conversation guided by options, not words to find alone."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What if we disagree on some preferences?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "You always configure what works for both partners — if an option doesn't appeal, simply don't select it. Consent is at the heart of the experience."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse suitable for varied orientations and dynamics?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — Caresse is designed to be inclusive. All orientations, gender identities, and relationship dynamics are welcome. The setup lets you define exactly who you are and what draws you in."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can Caresse be used on a first date?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse is better suited for people who already know each other a bit — configuring together involves talking about preferences. It's ideal from the moment you're comfortable having that conversation."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What if we don't agree on intensity?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "This is often where Caresse helps most. The setup naturally creates a conversation about your respective boundaries — without pressure or confrontation. You always choose the option that works for both."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
